# Styling

- Use Tailwind CSS utilities for all styling in this project.
- Do not introduce custom CSS rules, CSS modules, CSS-in-JS, inline style objects, or other styling frameworks.
- Keep CSS entry points limited to Tailwind imports and configuration needed by Tailwind.
- When changing existing styling, express it with Tailwind utilities.
